<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>EXPLANATORY NOTE</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">On July 20, 2026, at 9:00 p.m., Beijing Time (9:00
a.m. Eastern Time), Jin Medical International Ltd. (the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;) held a separate meeting of the holders of its Class A ordinary
shares, par value US$0.001 per share (the &ldquo;Class A Ordinary Shares&rdquo;) (the &ldquo;Class A Meeting&rdquo;), at No. 33 Lingxiang
Road, Wujin District, Changzhou City, Jiangsu Province, People&rsquo;s Republic of China. Immediately following the Class A Meeting, the
Company held a separate meeting of the holders of its Class B ordinary shares, par value US$0.001 per share (the &ldquo;Class B Ordinary
Shares&rdquo;) (the &ldquo;Class B Meeting&rdquo;), at the same location. Immediately following the Class B Meeting, the Company held
an extraordinary general meeting of shareholders (the &ldquo;Extraordinary General Meeting&rdquo;) at the same location.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">As of the close of business on June 26, 2026 (the
&ldquo;Record Date&rdquo;), there were 6,827,383 Class A Ordinary Shares and 1,000,000 Class B Ordinary Shares issued and outstanding.
Holders of Class A Ordinary Shares as of the Record Date were entitled to one (1) vote for each Class A Ordinary Share held on each matter
submitted to a vote at the applicable meeting, and holders of Class B Ordinary Shares as of the Record Date were entitled to thirty (30)
votes for each Class B Ordinary Share held on each matter submitted to a vote at the applicable meeting.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

